<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>四场物流大会跨会议对照 · 议题研究</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='12' fill='%231A2B4A'/%3E%3Cpath d='M14 44 L50 44 M20 38 L20 50 M44 38 L44 50 M28 18 L28 30 M36 18 L36 30' stroke='%23C8861A' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#1A2B4A; --ink2:#52647D; --ink3:#8D9AAB; --ink4:#C9D0D9;
  --bg:#F7F8FA; --card:#FFFFFF; --line:#E2E6EC; --amber:#C8861A; --amber-bg:#F7EFDD;
  --red:#B84C3A; --red-bg:#F6E7E4; --text:#252525; --muted:#767676;
  --h0:26px; --h1:21px; --h2:16px; --body:14.5px; --small:12.5px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{font-family:"Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC","Source Han Sans SC",-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-size:var(--body); line-height:1.65; overflow-x:hidden}
.wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 18px}
/* ===== 导航 ===== */
header{background:var(--ink); color:#fff; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50}
.nav{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:10px 0}
.brand{font-weight:700; font-size:15px; margin-right:16px; letter-spacing:.02em; color:#fff}
.brand b{color:var(--amber)}
.nav a{color:#D8DEE8; text-decoration:none; font-size:13.5px; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:6px; min-height:36px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center}
.nav a.on{background:var(--amber); color:#fff; font-weight:600}
.nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); color:#fff}
/* ===== 视图容器 ===== */
.view{display:none}
.view.on{display:block; animation:fade .18s ease}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
/* ===== 通用 ===== */
.hero{padding:26px 0 8px}
.hero h1{font-size:var(--h0); color:var(--ink); line-height:1.35; font-weight:800}
.hero p{color:var(--muted); margin-top:6px; font-size:var(--body); max-width:900px}
.tagline{margin-top:10px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px}
.tagline span{font-size:12px; color:var(--ink2); background:#EEF1F6; border:1px solid var(--ink4); padding:2px 10px; border-radius:20px}
.section{margin:26px 0}
.section h2{font-size:var(--h1); color:var(--ink); border-left:4px solid var(--amber); padding-left:10px; margin-bottom:12px}
.section h2 small{font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:400; margin-left:8px}
.card{background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px}
.grid{display:grid; gap:12px}
.grid.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.grid.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.sub-h{font-size:13px; color:var(--ink2); margin:0 0 8px; padding-left:8px; border-left:3px solid var(--amber); font-weight:600}
@media(max-width:640px){.grid.g2,.grid.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
@media(min-width:860px){.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}
@media(min-width:760px){.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1080px){.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
.badge{display:inline-block; font-size:11px; padding:1px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px; vertical-align:1px}
.badge.verify{background:var(--amber-bg); color:var(--amber); border:1px solid #E3C98F}
.badge.ok{background:#E4F0E4; color:#3E7C4F; border:1px solid #BFDCC4}
.badge.conf{background:var(--red-bg); color:var(--red); border:1px solid #E7C4BC}
.badge.cross{background:#EEF1F6; color:var(--ink2); border:1px solid var(--ink4)}
.badge.qg{font-weight:700}
.badge.qg-A{background:#E4F0E4; color:#2E7D32; border:1px solid #BFDCC4}
.badge.qg-B{background:#FFF3E0; color:#E65100; border:1px solid #F0D9B0}
.badge.qg-C{background:#ECEFF1; color:#546E7A; border:1px solid #D3DCE0}
.badge.qg-D{background:#F5F5F5; color:#9E9E9E; border:1px solid #E0E0E0}
.crow{display:flex; gap:10px; padding:7px 0; border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line); font-size:13.5px}
.crow:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.ck{flex:0 0 118px; color:var(--ink2); font-weight:600; padding-top:1px}
.cv{flex:1; min-width:0; line-height:1.55}
.cons{color:#3E7C4F; font-weight:600}
.div{color:var(--red); font-weight:600}
.sig{color:var(--amber); font-weight:600}
.muted{color:var(--muted); font-size:var(--small)}
.src{color:var(--ink3); font-size:11.5px}
/* ===== 热力矩阵 ===== */
.heat-legend{display:flex; gap:4px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0 12px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted)}
.hcell{width:26px; height:18px; border-radius:3px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06)}
table.heat{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; table-layout:fixed}
table.heat th,table.heat td{border:1px solid var(--line); padding:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:center}
table.heat th{background:#EEF1F6; color:var(--ink2); font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; padding:8px 4px; white-space:nowrap}
table.heat th.hname{width:16%; text-align:left; padding-left:10px}
table.heat td.hnum{font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; padding:10px 4px; transition:filter .12s; line-height:1.35}
table.heat td.hnum:hover{filter:brightness(.88); outline:2px solid var(--amber); outline-offset:-2px}
table.heat td.hnum .hn{display:block; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.2}
table.heat td.hnum .hp{display:block; font-size:10.5px; opacity:.78; margin-top:2px; font-weight:400}
table.heat td.hnum.dark{color:#fff}
table.heat td.hnum.dark .hp{opacity:.85}
table.heat td.avg{background:#F4F6FA; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink)}
table.heat td.cnt{background:#F4F6FA; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:640px){
  table.heat th.hname{font-size:11px; width:22%}
  table.heat td.hnum{font-size:10.5px; padding:8px 2px}
  table.heat td.hnum .hn{font-size:14px}
  table.heat th{font-size:10.5px; padding:6px 3px}
}
/* 侧栏 */
.overlay{position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(20,28,44,.45); z-index:80; display:none}
.overlay.on{display:block}
.panel{position:fixed; top:0; right:0; bottom:0; width:min(480px,94vw); background:#fff; z-index:90; display:none; transform:translateX(100%); transition:transform .22s ease; box-shadow:-8px 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18); overflow-y:auto; padding:22px 24px}
.panel.on{display:block; transform:none}
.panel h3{font-size:18px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:4px}
.panel .pt{color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; margin-bottom:14px}
.panel .txt{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-left:4px solid var(--amber); border-radius:6px; padding:12px 14px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px}
.panel .row{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); padding:6px 0; border-top:1px dashed var(--line)}
.close{position:absolute; top:14px; right:16px; width:36px; height:36px; border:none; border-radius:8px; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); cursor:pointer}
.close svg{display:block; width:18px; height:18px; margin:9px}
.close:hover{background:var(--ink4)}
/* ===== 列表 ===== */
ul.plain{list-style:none}
ul.plain li{padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line); font-size:13.8px}
ul.plain li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
/* ===== 议题主题页 ===== */
.topic-nav{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin:14px 0 18px}
.topic-nav button{border:1px solid var(--ink4); background:#fff; color:var(--ink2); font-size:12.5px; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:20px; cursor:pointer; min-height:34px}
.topic-nav button.on{background:var(--ink); color:#fff; border-color:var(--ink); font-weight:600}
.qblock{margin:14px 0}
.qblock .q{font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); border-left:4px solid var(--ink2); padding-left:10px; margin-bottom:8px}
.qblock .q small{color:var(--muted); font-weight:400; font-size:12px}
.qbody{font-size:14px; color:var(--text); padding:2px 0 2px 14px}
.qbody p{margin:5px 0}
.advice{display:grid; gap:10px}
@media(min-width:820px){.advice{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
.advice .ab{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:12px 14px}
.advice .ab b{font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); display:block; margin-bottom:5px}
.advice .ab p{font-size:13px; color:#3D4450}
/* ===== 时间线 ===== */
.tl{position:relative; margin:10px 0 26px}
.tl .trow{display:grid; grid-template-columns:88px 14px 1fr; gap:10px; margin-bottom:6px}
.tl .dot{width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--amber); border:3px solid #fff; box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--amber); justify-self:center; margin-top:20px}
.tl .tdate{text-align:right; color:var(--ink2); font-weight:600; font-size:12.5px; padding-top:14px}
.tl .tbody{background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px; font-size:13.5px}
.tl .tbody b{color:var(--ink)}
.tl .verdict{margin:12px 0 30px; background:var(--amber-bg); border:1px solid #E3C98F; border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px; font-size:13.5px}
.tl .verdict b{color:var(--amber)}
/* ===== 检索 ===== */
.searchbar{display:flex; gap:8px; margin:10px 0 14px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.searchbar input{flex:1; min-width:220px; height:42px; border:1px solid var(--ink4); border-radius:8px; padding:0 14px; font-size:16px; font-family:inherit; background:#fff; color:var(--text)}
.searchbar input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--ink2)}
.tabs{display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:12px}
.tabs button{border:1px solid var(--ink4); background:#fff; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink2); min-height:36px}
.tabs button.on{background:var(--ink); color:#fff; border-color:var(--ink)}
table.data{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; table-layout:fixed; font-size:12.5px}
table.data th{background:#EEF1F6; color:var(--ink2); padding:8px 6px; text-align:left; border:1px solid var(--line); font-weight:600}
table.data td{border:1px solid var(--line); padding:7px 6px; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word}
table.data td.note{font-size:11.5px}
footer{margin:34px 0 20px; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:14px}
kbd{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:4px; padding:0 5px; font-size:11px; color:var(--ink2)}
@media print{header,.tabs,.searchbar,.topic-nav{display:none}}
.mini{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.mini:hover{opacity:.85}
.caseCards{display:none}
.ccard{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:var(--card)}
.ccard-top{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px}
.ccard-top b{flex:1}
@media(max-width:720px){
  .caseTable{display:none}
  .caseCards{display:block}
  .panel{width:100%!important;left:0!important;top:0!important;height:100%!important;border-radius:0}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap nav">
  <div class="brand">四场物流大会 · <b>议题跨会议对照</b></div>
  <a href="#home" data-v="home">一页看懂</a>
  <a href="#topics" data-v="topics">议题主题页</a>
  <a href="#timeline" data-v="timeline">时间线</a>
  <a href="#search" data-v="search">检索</a>
</div></header>

<div class="wrap">
  <!-- ===== 首页：一页看懂 ===== -->
  <section id="home" class="view on">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>四场物流行业大会 · 议题跨会议对照</h1>
      <p>第十一届物流技术大会（2026-03）→ 第九届物流包装技术发展大会（2026-07-03）→ 第三届仓储智能物流系统核心零部件交流会（2026-08-26）→ 第四届中物联仓储技术大会（2026-09-21）。按 12 项议题重组四场会议，标注共识、分歧、新信号与待核数据。</p>
      <div class="tagline"><span>按议题重组，不按会议组织</span><span>报告为抽取主源，速记用于溯源抽查</span><span>数字默认待核</span><span>个别嘉宾说法≠行业共识</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>议题 × 会议热力矩阵 <small>点击单元格展开该会议对该议题的原话摘要与来源</small></h2>
      <div class="heat-legend" id="heatLegend"></div>
      <table class="heat" id="heatTable"></table>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>共识 / 分歧 / 新信号总表 <small>按印证状态区分：跨会议印证（≥2 场独立会议）vs 单场说法</small></h2>
      <div class="grid g3">
        <div><h3 class="sub-h">共识（跨会议印证）</h3><div class="card"><ul class="plain" id="consList"></ul></div></div>
        <div><h3 class="sub-h">分歧</h3><div class="card"><ul class="plain" id="divList"></ul></div></div>
        <div><h3 class="sub-h">新信号</h3><div class="card"><ul class="plain" id="sigList"></ul></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section"><h2>关键数据冲突与口误 <small>待核 / 已核</small></h2>
      <div class="card"><ul class="plain" id="confList"></ul></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== 议题主题页 ===== -->
  <section id="topics" class="view">
    <div class="hero"><h1>议题主题页</h1><p>每个议题固定回答六问：各会议怎么说、共识在哪、分歧在哪、数据口径有无冲突、还有什么没搞清楚、政府/协会/企业启示。</p></div>
    <div class="topic-nav" id="topicNav"></div>
    <div id="topicBody"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== 时间线 ===== -->
  <section id="timeline" class="view">
    <div class="hero"><h1>会议时间线</h1><p>3月 → 7月 → 8月底 → 9月，并列呈现每个议题在四场会议的提法；仅在证据充分时下趋势结论，无法判断的标注"推断，需核实"。</p></div>
    <div id="tlBody"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== 检索 ===== -->
  <section id="search" class="view">
    <div class="hero"><h1>检索</h1><p>在案例、数据口径、嘉宾三类记录中搜索；每条记录标注来源与待核状态。</p></div>
    <div class="searchbar"><input id="q" type="text" placeholder="输入关键词，如：海川 / 托盘 / 回收率 / 马增荣 …"></div>
    <div class="filterbar" id="caseFilters" style="display:none;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px">
      <select id="fMeet"><option value="">全部会议</option><option>物流技术大会</option><option>包装会</option><option>核心零部件会</option><option>仓储会</option></select>
      <select id="fSt"><option value="">全部可信度</option><option>速记一致</option><option>仅报告转述</option><option>外部核实</option></select>
      <select id="fQ"><option value="">全部（量化分级）</option><option value="A">A·有基线效果量化</option><option value="B">B·效果数字但基线不清/目标</option><option value="C">C·规模/背景数字</option><option value="D">D·无量化</option></select>
      <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)"><input type="checkbox" id="selAll"> 全选本页</label>
      <button id="exportSel" class="mini">导出所选引用（.txt）</button>
      <span id="selCount" class="muted" style="font-size:13px"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs" id="searchTabs"></div>
    <div id="searchOut"></div>
  </section>

  <footer>证据来源分级（取已达到的最高一级）：<kbd>外部核实</kbd>＝已与年报、官网、政府/协会统计或权威媒体对上，可直接引用并注明来源；<kbd>速记一致</kbd>＝仅说明嘉宾确实这么说，未经外部核实，引用须写"据××在××会议上介绍"；<kbd>仅报告转述</kbd>＝既无外部核实也无速记对证，引用前须二次核实。风险标记：<kbd>存疑</kbd>＝与外部来源冲突或量级明显不合理，核实前不引用；<kbd>口径特殊</kbd>＝数字有适用范围，引用须带口径。仅供内部研究参考。</footer>
</div>

<div class="overlay" id="ovl"></div>
<aside class="panel" id="panel">
  <button class="close" id="pClose" aria-label="关闭"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
  <h3 id="pT"></h3>
  <div class="pt" id="pSub"></div>
  <div class="txt" id="pTxt"></div>
  <div class="row"><span>来源章节</span><span id="pSrc"></span></div>
  <div class="row"><span>命中次数（每万字热度）</span><span id="pNum"></span></div>
  <div class="row"><span>状态</span><span id="pFlag"></span></div>
</aside>

<script>
